ection sign-off -- distinct from both a service dispatch and a manufacturing batch release", :adr/blueprint-count-updated-again-4321 "ADR-2607101400's own (is (= 6 (:blueprint m))) assertion updated to (is (= 7 (:blueprint m))), continuing the 'not a fixed invariant' framing ADR-2607100500 established. Added a live-state corroboration assertion ((is (= :blueprint (industry/maturity \"4321\")))) alongside the six prior live-state corroboration tests and the synthetic-fixture-based unit test", :adr/fresh-governor-no-collision-4321 "this blueprint's own :itonami.blueprint/governor keyword, :electrical-trade-governor, is grep-verified UNIQUE within the ISIC-numbered cloud-itonami-isic-* series -- distinct from :electrical-install-governor, used by the SEPARATE cloud-itonami-unspsc-39 UNSPSC-classified sub-fleet, a deliberate choice not to reuse a similar-sounding keyword from a different sub-fleet", :adr/fleet-maturity-after "{:implemented 106, :blueprint 7, :spec 533, :total 646}", :adr/date "2026-07-09", :adr/test-status-4321 "kotoba-lang/industry's own full test suite re-run with the local-root technology override before committing -- 7 tests / 160 assertions, all green", :db/id -1, :adr/blueprint-only-artifacts-4321 "published README.md, blueprint.edn, docs/business-model.md, docs/operator-guide.md, CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md, CONTRIBUTING.md, GOVERNANCE.md, SECURITY.md, LICENSE (AGPL-3.0-or-later, verbatim) -- SAME artifact set as every prior fresh-blueprint publication this scope. Deliberately NO src/test/deps.edn/docs/adr/0001-architecture.md", :adr/registry-field-replacement-4321 "the existing '4321' registry entry had its :repo, :business-id and :optional-technologies fields updated, and its explicit :maturity :spec override REMOVED so maturity/maturity-of now auto-derive :blueprint from the real :repo presence", :adr/west-registration-deliberately-not-done-4321 "same established precedent as every prior fresh-blueprint build this scope: none of the cloud-itonami-isic-